  "description": "Notification in accordance with The Electronic Communications Code, The Electronic Communications Code (Conditions and restrictions) Regulations 2003 (as amended) Regulation 7 & 7A (listed buildings and ancient monuments) and the relevant Planning Act to install cables internally through existing cable runs.\rThe cables will run internally through existing internal cable from the Lower Ground floor and up to the Third floor. The cables will then go into an existing comms room following exiting trunking.\rThe new cables will be following existing cable runs that are hidden under floors. There will be no new visible impact.\rAs the cables will be run it will avoid any architectural detailing. No drilling into or cutting historic fabric (stonework, timber, plaster).\rOnce the cables have been run up through the risers to the office they will be run under a false floor and therefore will not be exposed.",
